          "code": "INTENT_RETREIVAL",
          "id": "1765776168708",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765776168711_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "ROLE\n\nYou are a deterministic rule-to-JSON parser.\n\nOutput JSON only.\n\nDo not explain.\nDo not infer missing meaning.\nDo not guess.\nDo not fabricate attribute names, values, keys, operators, conditions, outcomes, or intent.\n\nOnly use information explicitly present in the input.\n\nINPUT\n\nRead:\n{{$context.$variables.pInputPayload}}\n\nPROCESS\n\n1. If pInputPayload.Ruleset.rules exists and contains one or more rules:\n   - Process each rules[i].userProvidedQuery.\n\n2. If no rules exist:\n   - Output exactly one rule.\n   - Set:\n     - agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\"\n     - errorInfo = \"No actionable instruction\"\n\n3. If userProvidedQuery is null, empty, or whitespace:\n   - Set:\n     - agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\"\n     - errorInfo = \"No actionable instruction\"\n\nDEFAULTS\n\nagentOperation = \"UPSERT\"\n\ncategory = \"Defaulting\"\n\nsubCategory:\n- Preserve existing non-empty value.\n- Otherwise \"\"\n\nuiId:\n- Preserve existing non-empty value.\n- Otherwise \"\"\n\nrulePK:\n- Preserve existing non-empty value.\n- Otherwise \"\"\n\nruleStatus = \"Active\"\n\nagentRuleProcessStatus = \"Success\"\n\nerrorInfo = \"\"\n\nruleOperation:\n- \"UPDATE\" if uiId is non-empty\n- OR rulePK is non-empty and rulePK != \"0\"\n- Otherwise \"CREATE\"\n\nPRESERVATION RULES\n\nNever modify existing non-empty:\n- uiId\n- rulePK\n- subCategory\n\nThe following keys must always be empty strings:\n\n- attributeKey = \"\"\n- valueKey = \"\"\n- value1Key = \"\"\n- value2Key = \"\"\n\nThe following labels are constants and must never change:\n\n- outcome1 = \"Target Attribute\"\n- outcome2 = \"Value\"\n\nUPDATE LIMITS\n\nIf ruleOperation = \"UPDATE\":\n\nOnly these fields may change:\n\n- ruleStatus\n- ruleOutcomes[].value2\n- ruleConditions[].attributeValue\n\nIf any other field is modified:\n\n- agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\"\n- errorInfo = \"Unsupported field update\"\n\nINSTRUCTION TYPES\n\nSupported instruction types:\n\n1. Enable / Disable\n2. General Mapping\n\nAnything else:\n\n- agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\"\n- errorInfo = \"No actionable instruction\"\n\nENABLE / DISABLE\n\nRecognize:\n\n- enable\n- disable\n\nActions:\n\nenable:\n- ruleStatus = \"Active\"\n\ndisable:\n- ruleStatus = \"Inactive\"\n\nIf uiId is referenced:\n- ruleOperation = \"UPDATE\"\n\nKeep existing conditions and outcomes unless new conditions are explicitly provided.\n\nGENERAL MAPPING\n\nIgnore leading filler phrases such as:\n\n- create a rule to\n- create rule to\n- create rule\n- create a rule\n- define a rule to\n- define rule to\n\nThen identify the first matching mapping pattern.\n\nSupported patterns:\n\n- set X to Y\n- set X as Y\n\n- default X to Y\n- default X as Y\n\n- populate X with Y\n- fill X with Y\n\n- use Y for X\n- use Y as X\n\n- copy A to B\n- copy A into B\n- copy from A to B\n\n- X = Y\n- X == Y\n\n- X is Y\n- X equals Y\n- X should be Y\n- X must be Y\n\nValidation:\n\nIf target attribute is missing:\n- errorInfo = \"Missing target attribute\"\n\nIf target value is missing:\n- errorInfo = \"Missing target value\"\n\nPreserve exact casing.\nTrim outer whitespace only.\n\nCONDITIONS\n\nIf the query contains:\n\n- when\n- if\n- where\n\nParse everything after the first occurrence.\n\nExamples:\n\n\"default product category as Electronics when business unit is Vision Operations\"\n\nCondition text:\n\n\"business unit is Vision Operations\"\n\nSUPPORTED OPERATORS\n\nequals\nnot equals\ngreater than\nless than\ngreater than or equals\nless than or equals\nin\nnot in\nbetween\nis null\nis not null\ncontains\nstarts with\nends with\n\nNORMALIZATION\n\nequals:\n\n- is\n- equals\n- equal to\n- =\n- ==\n\n→ equals\n\nnot equals:\n\n- is not\n- not equals\n- does not equal\n- !=\n- <>\n\n→ not equals\n\ngreater than:\n\n- >\n\n→ greater than\n\nless than:\n\n- <\n\n→ less than\n\ngreater than or equals:\n\n- >=\n\n→ greater than or equals\n\nless than or equals:\n\n- <=\n\n→ less than or equals\n\nLOGICAL OPERATORS\n\nFirst condition:\n\nlogicalOperator = \"AND\"\n\nUse:\n\nlogicalOperator = \"OR\"\n\nonly when OR is explicitly present.\n\nCONDITION TYPE\n\nUse:\n\nconditionType = \"condition\"\n\nwhen operator is:\n\n- greater than\n- less than\n- greater than or equals\n- less than or equals\n- between\n- in\n- not in\n- not equals\n- is null\n- is not null\n\nOtherwise:\n\nconditionType = \"mappingset\"\n\nVALIDATION\n\nIf condition text exists but cannot be parsed:\n\n- agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\"\n- errorInfo = \"No actionable instruction\"\n\nIf operator exists but is unsupported:\n\n- agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\"\n- errorInfo = \"Unsupported operator\"\n\nFOR ALL\n\nIf query contains:\n\n- for all X\n- for all Xs\n\nAdd condition:\n\n{\n  \"conditionType\": \"mappingset\",\n  \"attribute\": \"X\",\n  \"attributeKey\": \"\",\n  \"operator\": \"equals\",\n  \"attributeValue\": \"*\",\n  \"valueKey\": \"\",\n  \"logicalOperator\": \"AND\"\n}\n\nDo not create duplicates.\n\nOUTCOME STRUCTURE\n\nEach ruleOutcomes array must contain exactly two objects:\n\n{\n  \"outcome1\": \"Target Attribute\",\n  \"value1\": \"<target attribute>\",\n  \"value1Key\": \"\"\n}\n\n{\n  \"outcome2\": \"Value\",\n  \"value2\": \"<target value>\",\n  \"value2Key\": \"\"\n}\n\nSUMMARY FIELDS\n\nconditionsSummary\n\nIf conditions exist:\n\nJoin in order:\n\n<attribute> <operator> <attributeValue>\n\nInsert each condition's logicalOperator between items.\n\nOtherwise:\n\n\"\"\n\nactionSummary\n\nEnable:\n\"enable the rule\"\n\nDisable:\n\"disable the rule\"\n\nMapping:\n\"set <value1> = <value2>\"\n\nagentRuleText\n\nIf conditionsSummary is not empty:\n\n\"When \" + conditionsSummary + \", \" + actionSummary\n\nOtherwise:\n\nactionSummary\n\nbusinessApplicability\n\nIf no conditions:\n\n\"\"\n\nOtherwise:\n\nFor each condition create:\n\n<attribute> is <attributeValue>\n\nFormatting:\n\n1 condition:\n\n\"When \" + clause1\n\n2 conditions:\n\n\"When \" + clause1 + \", and \" + clause2\n\n3+ conditions:\n\n\"When \" + clause1 + \", \" + clause2 + \", ... , and \" + lastClause\n\nIgnore logicalOperator when formatting.\n\nDo not add parentheses.\nDo not add extra text.\n\nERROR STRINGS\n\nUse only these exact values:\n\n\"No actionable instruction\"\n\n\"Missing target attribute\"\n\n\"Missing target value\"\n\n\"Unsupported operator\"\n\n\"Unsupported field update\"\n\n\"Ambiguous mapping\"\n\nIMPORTANT EXAMPLE\n\nInput:\n\n\"Create a rule to default product category as Electronics when business unit is Vision Operations\"\n\nOutput interpretation:\n\nCondition:\n- attribute = \"business unit\"\n- operator = \"equals\"\n- attributeValue = \"Vision Operations\"\n\nOutcome:\n- value1 = \"product category\"\n- value2 = \"Electronics\"\n\nStatus:\n- Success\n\nJSON SCHEMA (EXACT SHAPE - DO NOT DEVIATE)\n\n{\n  \"agentOperation\": \"UPSERT\",\n  \"Ruleset\": [\n    {\n      \"category\": \"Defaulting\",\n      \"subCategory\": \"\",\n      \"rules\": [\n        {\n          \"uiId\": \"\",\n          \"rulePK\": \"\",\n          \"userProvidedQuery\": \"Exact directive string\",\n          \"agentRuleText\": \"Concise summary\",\n          \"businessApplicability\": \"BusinessApplicability\",\n          \"ruleConditions\": [\n            {\n              \"conditionType\": \"condition|mappingset\",\n              \"attribute\": \"attribute name\",\n              \"attributeKey\": \"\",\n              \"operator\": \"Normalized operator\",\n              \"attributeValue\": \"Value as provided\",\n              \"valueKey\": \"\",\n              \"logicalOperator\": \"AND\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"ruleOutcomes\": [\n            {\n              \"outcome1\": \"Target Attribute\",\n              \"value1\": \"<Target attribute label>\",\n              \"value1Key\": \"\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"outcome2\": \"Value\",\n              \"value2\": \"<Target value or source attribute label>\",\n              \"value2Key\": \"\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"agentRuleProcessStatus\": \"Success\",\n          \"errorInfo\": \"\",\n          \"ruleOperation\": \"CREATE\",\n          \"ruleStatus\": \"Active\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get Input Variables"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765171796822"
          },
          "code": "GET_INPUT_VARIABLES",
          "id": "1766468555233",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766468587939",
              "name": "pInputPayload",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.pInputPayload}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "1766468567192",
              "name": "pEntityClassCode",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.pApplicationContext}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Validate Attributes",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "// ============================================\n// INPUTS\n// ============================================\nvar intentPayload = $context.$nodes.INTENT_RETREIVAL.$output || new Object();\nvar sourceAttributes = ($context.$nodes.GET_ALL_SOURCE_ATTRIBUTES.$output && $context.$nodes.GET_ALL_SOURCE_ATTRIBUTES.$output.items)\n  ? $context.$nodes.GET_ALL_SOURCE_ATTRIBUTES.$output.items\n  : [];\nvar targetAttributes = ($context.$nodes.GET_TARGET_ATTRIBUTES.$output.items) ? $context.$nodes.GET_TARGET_ATTRIBUTES.$output.items : [];\n\n// ============================================\n// MAPPINGS\n// ============================================\nvar attributeMappings = $context.$variables.pAttributeMapping;\n\n// ============================================\n// LOOKUPS\n// ============================================\nvar srcByCode = new Object();\nvar srcCodeByNameLC = new Object();\nfor (var k = 0; k < sourceAttributes.length; k++) {\n  var s = sourceAttributes[k];\n  if (s && s.AttributeCode) {\n    srcByCode[String(s.AttributeCode)] = s;\n  }\n  if (s && s.AttributeName) {\n    var sNameLC = String(s.AttributeName).replace(/\\s+/g, \"\").trim().toLowerCase();\n    srcCodeByNameLC[sNameLC] = String(s.AttributeCode);\n  }\n}\n\nvar tgtByCode = new Object();\nvar tgtCodeByNameLC = new Object();\nfor (var t = 0; t < targetAttributes.length; t++) {\n  var ta = targetAttributes[t];\n  if (ta && ta.AttributeCode) tgtByCode[String(ta.AttributeCode)] = ta;\n  if (ta && ta.Name) {\n    var tNameLC = String(ta.Name).replace(/\\s+/g, \"\").trim().toLowerCase();\n    tgtCodeByNameLC[tNameLC] = String(ta.AttributeCode);\n  }\n}\n\n// ============================================\n// PROCESS RULES\n// ============================================\nvar agentOperation = intentPayload.agentOperation ? intentPayload.agentOperation : \"UPSERT\";\nvar rulesetArrayIn = Array.isArray(intentPayload.Ruleset) ? intentPayload.Ruleset : [];\n\nvar newRulesetArray = [];\nvar ruleSequence = 1;\n\nfor (var catIdx = 0; catIdx < rulesetArrayIn.length; catIdx++) {\n  var categoryObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(rulesetArrayIn[catIdx]));\n  var rulesIn = Array.isArray(categoryObj.rules) ? categoryObj.rules : [];\n\n  var newRules = [];\n  var categorySubCat = \"\";\n\n  for (var r = 0; r < rulesIn.length; r++) {\n    var rule = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(rulesIn[r]));\n\n    if (!rule.uiId || rule.uiId === \"\") {\n      rule.uiId = \"C_\" + (\"00\" + ruleSequence).slice(-3);\n      ruleSequence++;\n    }\n\n    var hasError = false;\n    var errorMessages = [];\n    var targetAttributeCode = \"\";\n\n    // CONDITIONS (SOURCE)\n    var conditionsIn = Array.isArray(rule.ruleConditions) ? rule.ruleConditions : [];\n    var newConditions = [];\n    for (var c = 0; c < conditionsIn.length; c++) {\n      var cond = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(conditionsIn[c]));\n      if (cond) {\n        var srcCodeResolved = \"\";\n\n        if (cond.attribute) {\n          var attrNameLC = String(cond.attribute).replace(/\\s+/g, \"\").trim().toLowerCase();\n          if (srcCodeByNameLC[attrNameLC]) {\n            srcCodeResolved = srcCodeByNameLC[attrNameLC];\n          }\n        }\n\n        if (!srcCodeResolved && cond.attributeKey) {\n          var existingCode = String(cond.attributeKey);\n          if (srcByCode[existingCode]) {\n            srcCodeResolved = existingCode;\n          }\n        }\n\n        if (srcCodeResolved) {\n          cond.attributeKey = srcCodeResolved;\n        } else if (cond.attribute) {\n          hasError = true;\n          errorMessages.push(\"Invalid source attribute: '\" + String(cond.attribute) + \"' is not a valid source attribute\");\n        } else if (cond.attributeKey) {\n          hasError = true;\n          errorMessages.push(\"Invalid source attribute code: '\" + cond.attributeKey + \"'\");\n        }\n      }\n      newConditions.push(cond);\n    }\n    rule.ruleConditions = newConditions;\n\n    // OUTCOMES (TARGET)\n    var outcomesIn = Array.isArray(rule.ruleOutcomes) ? rule.ruleOutcomes : [];\n    var newOutcomes = [];\n    for (var o = 0; o < outcomesIn.length; o++) {\n      var out = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(outcomesIn[o]));\n      if (out && out.outcome1 === \"Target Attribute\" && out.value1) {\n        var tgtCodeResolved = \"\";\n\n        var tgtNameLC = String(out.value1).replace(/\\s+/g, \"\").trim().toLowerCase();\n        if (tgtCodeByNameLC[tgtNameLC]) {\n          tgtCodeResolved = tgtCodeByNameLC[tgtNameLC];\n        }\n\n        if (!tgtCodeResolved) {\n          var value1AsCode = String(out.value1).trim();\n          if (tgtByCode[value1AsCode]) {\n            tgtCodeResolved = value1AsCode;\n          }\n        }\n\n        if (!tgtCodeResolved && out.value1Key) {\n          var existingTgtCode = String(out.value1Key).trim();\n          if (tgtByCode[existingTgtCode]) {\n            tgtCodeResolved = existingTgtCode;\n          }\n        }\n\n        if (tgtCodeResolved) {\n          out.value1Key = tgtCodeResolved;\n          targetAttributeCode = tgtCodeResolved;\n        } else {\n          hasError = true;\n          errorMessages.push(\"Invalid target attribute: '\" + String(out.value1) + \"' is not a valid target attribute\");\n        }\n      }\n      newOutcomes.push(out);\n    }\n    rule.ruleOutcomes = newOutcomes;\n\n    // SUBCATEGORY\n    if (targetAttributeCode && srcByCode[targetAttributeCode]) {\n      var sourceAttr = srcByCode[targetAttributeCode];\n      if (sourceAttr.AttributeGroupCode) {\n        var groupCode = String(sourceAttr.AttributeGroupCode).toUpperCase();\n        var subCat = \"\";\n\n        if (groupCode.indexOf(\"ORA_DFF\") !== -1)              subCat = \"Descriptive Flexfield\";\n        else if (groupCode.indexOf(\"ORA_ENTERPRISE\") !== -1)  subCat = \"Enterprise\";\n        else if (groupCode.indexOf(\"ORA_TAX\") !== -1)         subCat = \"Tax\";\n        else if (groupCode.indexOf(\"ORA_GLOBAL_DFF\") !== -1)  subCat = \"Global descriptive flexfield\";\n        else if (groupCode.indexOf(\"ORA_PROJECT\") !== -1)     subCat = \"Project\";\n        else if (groupCode.indexOf(\"ORA_ASSET\") !== -1)       subCat = \"Asset\";\n        else if (groupCode.indexOf(\"ORA_TRANSACTION\") !== -1) subCat = \"Transaction\";\n        else if (groupCode.indexOf(\"ORA_ACCOUNT\") !== -1)     subCat = \"Accounting\";\n\n        if (subCat) categorySubCat = subCat;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // STATUS\n    if (hasError) {\n      rule.agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\";\n      var errorInfo = \"\";\n      for (var e = 0; e < errorMessages.length; e++) {\n        if (e > 0) errorInfo += \"; \";\n        errorInfo += errorMessages[e];\n      }\n      rule.errorInfo = errorInfo;\n    } else {\n      if (!rule.agentRuleProcessStatus) rule.agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Success\";\n      if (!rule.errorInfo) rule.errorInfo = \"\";\n    }\n\n    // ============================================\n    // DEPENDENCY CHECK (only when status is Success)\n    // ============================================\n    if (rule.agentRuleProcessStatus === \"Success\") {\n\n      // --- Build a quick lookup: which attributeKeys are present in ruleConditions ---\n      var condKeyPresent = new Object();\n      var conditionsForDep = Array.isArray(rule.ruleConditions) ? rule.ruleConditions : [];\n      for (var cp = 0; cp < conditionsForDep.length; cp++) {\n        var cpItem = conditionsForDep[cp];\n        if (cpItem && cpItem.attributeKey && cpItem.attributeKey !== \"\") {\n          condKeyPresent[String(cpItem.attributeKey)] = true;\n        }\n      }\n\n      // --- STEP 1: Check outcome value1Key dependency ---\n      var depCheckOutcome1Name = \"\";\n      var depCheckValue1Key = \"\";\n      var depCheckOutcomes = Array.isArray(rule.ruleOutcomes) ? rule.ruleOutcomes : [];\n\n      for (var dco = 0; dco < depCheckOutcomes.length; dco++) {\n        var dcoItem = depCheckOutcomes[dco];\n        if (dcoItem && dcoItem.outcome1 === \"Target Attribute\" && dcoItem.value1Key && dcoItem.value1Key !== \"\") {\n          depCheckOutcome1Name = dcoItem.value1 ? String(dcoItem.value1) : \"\";\n          depCheckValue1Key = String(dcoItem.value1Key);\n        }\n      }\n\n      if (depCheckValue1Key !== \"\") {\n        var outcomeMappingEntry = null;\n        if (attributeMappings[depCheckValue1Key]) {\n          outcomeMappingEntry = attributeMappings[depCheckValue1Key];\n        }\n        if (outcomeMappingEntry !== null && outcomeMappingEntry.depValue !== null && outcomeMappingEntry.depValue !== \"\") {\n          var outcomeRequiredDepKey = String(outcomeMappingEntry.depValue);\n          if (!condKeyPresent[outcomeRequiredDepKey]) {\n            var outcomeDepLookupName = \"\";\n            if (srcByCode[outcomeRequiredDepKey] && srcByCode[outcomeRequiredDepKey].AttributeName) {\n              outcomeDepLookupName = String(srcByCode[outcomeRequiredDepKey].AttributeName);\n            } else {\n              outcomeDepLookupName = outcomeRequiredDepKey;\n            }\n            rule.agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\";\n            rule.errorInfo = \"For target \" + depCheckOutcome1Name + \", source \" + outcomeDepLookupName + \" is required to default the values\";\n          }\n        }\n      }\n\n      // --- STEP 2: Check each ruleCondition's attributeKey dependency ---\n      if (rule.agentRuleProcessStatus === \"Success\") {\n        var condDepErrors = [];\n        var conditionsForDepCheck = Array.isArray(rule.ruleConditions) ? rule.ruleConditions : [];\n\n        for (var cd = 0; cd < conditionsForDepCheck.length; cd++) {\n          var cdCond = conditionsForDepCheck[cd];\n          if (cdCond && cdCond.attributeKey && cdCond.attributeKey !== \"\") {\n            var cdKey = String(cdCond.attributeKey);\n            var cdMapping = null;\n            if (attributeMappings[cdKey]) {\n              cdMapping = attributeMappings[cdKey];\n            }\n            if (cdMapping !== null && cdMapping.depValue !== null && cdMapping.depValue !== \"\") {\n              var cdRequiredDep = String(cdMapping.depValue);\n              if (!condKeyPresent[cdRequiredDep]) {\n                // Required dep is missing from conditions — build error\n                var cdDepLookupName = \"\";\n                if (srcByCode[cdRequiredDep] && srcByCode[cdRequiredDep].AttributeName) {\n                  cdDepLookupName = String(srcByCode[cdRequiredDep].AttributeName);\n                } else {\n                  cdDepLookupName = cdRequiredDep;\n                }\n                var cdCondAttrName = \"\";\n                if (srcByCode[cdKey] && srcByCode[cdKey].AttributeName) {\n                  cdCondAttrName = String(srcByCode[cdKey].AttributeName);\n                } else {\n                  cdCondAttrName = cdKey;\n                }\n                condDepErrors.push(\"For Applicability source\" + cdCondAttrName + \", source \" + cdDepLookupName + \" is required as a dependent condition\");\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n\n        if (condDepErrors.length > 0) {\n          rule.agentRuleProcessStatus = \"Failed\";\n          var condDepErrorInfo = \"\";\n          for (var cde = 0; cde < condDepErrors.length; cde++) {\n            if (cde > 0) condDepErrorInfo += \"; \";\n            condDepErrorInfo += condDepErrors[cde];\n          }\n          rule.errorInfo = condDepErrorInfo;\n        }\n      }\n\n      // --- STEP 3: Topological sort of ruleConditions (deepest dependency first) ---\n      if (rule.agentRuleProcessStatus === \"Success\") {\n        var conditionsToSort = Array.isArray(rule.ruleConditions) ? rule.ruleConditions : [];\n\n        if (conditionsToSort.length > 1) {\n\n          // Build a map of attributeKey -> condition object for fast lookup\n          var condByKey = new Object();\n          for (var sb = 0; sb < conditionsToSort.length; sb++) {\n            var sbItem = conditionsToSort[sb];\n            if (sbItem && sbItem.attributeKey && sbItem.attributeKey !== \"\") {\n              condByKey[String(sbItem.attributeKey)] = sbItem;\n            }\n          }\n\n\n          // Build in-degree count and adjacency: depValue -> dependant\n          var inDegree = new Object();\n          var dependants = new Object(); // key -> list of keys that depend on key\n\n          for (var ka = 0; ka < conditionsToSort.length; ka++) {\n            var kaItem = conditionsToSort[ka];\n            if (kaItem && kaItem.attributeKey && kaItem.attributeKey !== \"\") {\n              var kaKey = String(kaItem.attributeKey);\n              if (!inDegree[kaKey]) inDegree[kaKey] = 0;\n              if (!dependants[kaKey]) dependants[kaKey] = [];\n\n              var kaMapping = null;\n              if (attributeMappings[kaKey]) kaMapping = attributeMappings[kaKey];\n\n              if (kaMapping !== null && kaMapping.depValue !== null && kaMapping.depValue !== \"\") {\n                var kaDepKey = String(kaMapping.depValue);\n                // kaKey depends on kaDepKey — so kaDepKey must come first\n                // increment inDegree of kaKey, add kaKey to dependants of kaDepKey\n                inDegree[kaKey] = (inDegree[kaKey] || 0) + 1;\n                if (!dependants[kaDepKey]) dependants[kaDepKey] = [];\n                dependants[kaDepKey].push(kaKey);\n              }\n            }\n          }\n\n          // Collect all keys with inDegree 0 into a queue (these have no dependencies)\n          var sortQueue = [];\n          var sortedKeys = [];\n\n          for (var qi = 0; qi < conditionsToSort.length; qi++) {\n            var qiItem = conditionsToSort[qi];\n            if (qiItem && qiItem.attributeKey && qiItem.attributeKey !== \"\") {\n              var qiKey = String(qiItem.attributeKey);\n              if (!inDegree[qiKey] || inDegree[qiKey] === 0) {\n                sortQueue.push(qiKey);\n              }\n            }\n          }\n\n          // Process queue \n          var safetyCounter = 0;\n          while (sortQueue.length > 0 && safetyCounter < 500) {\n            safetyCounter++;\n            // Shift first item from queue\n            var currentKey = sortQueue[0];\n            var newQueue = [];\n            for (var sq = 1; sq < sortQueue.length; sq++) {\n              newQueue.push(sortQueue[sq]);\n            }\n            sortQueue = newQueue;\n\n            sortedKeys.push(currentKey);\n\n            // For each node that depends on currentKey, reduce its inDegree\n            var currentDependants = dependants[currentKey] ? dependants[currentKey] : [];\n            for (var di = 0; di < currentDependants.length; di++) {\n              var depKey = String(currentDependants[di]);\n              inDegree[depKey] = (inDegree[depKey] || 1) - 1;\n              if (inDegree[depKey] === 0) {\n                sortQueue.push(depKey);\n              }\n            }\n          }\n\n          // Rebuild ruleConditions in sorted order\n          // Any condition whose attributeKey wasn't in the sort (no mapping entry) goes at front\n          var sortedConditions = [];\n\n          // First pass: add sorted keys that exist in condByKey\n          for (var sk = 0; sk < sortedKeys.length; sk++) {\n            var skKey = sortedKeys[sk];\n            if (condByKey[skKey]) {\n              sortedConditions.push(condByKey[skKey]);\n            }\n          }\n\n          // Second pass: append any conditions not captured by sort (safety net)\n          for (var rem = 0; rem < conditionsToSort.length; rem++) {\n            var remItem = conditionsToSort[rem];\n            var remFound = false;\n            for (var chk = 0; chk < sortedConditions.length; chk++) {\n              if (sortedConditions[chk] === remItem) {\n                remFound = true;\n              }\n            }\n            if (!remFound) {\n              sortedConditions.push(remItem);\n            }\n          }\n\n          rule.ruleConditions = sortedConditions;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    newRules.push(rule);\n  }\n\n  if (categorySubCat) {\n    categoryObj.subCategory = categorySubCat;\n  }\n\n  categoryObj.rules = newRules;\n  newRulesetArray.push(categoryObj);\n}\n\n// ============================================\n// OUTPUT\n// ============================================\nvar ruleoutput = new Object();\nruleoutput.agentOperation = agentOperation;\nruleoutput.Ruleset = newRulesetArray;\n\nreturn ruleoutput;"
          },
